  "body": "[`is_trial_user`](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/8af8a9bce5319ebf99573433f9f89d94767e173c/synapse/storage/databases/main/registration.py#L216-L231) is used to determine whether a given user is within the \"trial period\" for MAU. This is a grace period that means users who are active for less than N days are not counted as active users as far as MAU is concerned.\r\n\r\nWe've got a use case where specific users (as determined by their registration origin) will have different trial periods, so one way of achieving this would be a module callback to determine this.\r\n",
